{"seq":2,"slug":"debates","title":"Debates","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zhuangzi/controversies-and-appraisal/debates","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"escapism-or-wisdom","title":"消极避世之议","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zhuangzi/controversies-and-appraisal/debates/escapism-or-wisdom","wordCount":1851,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"relativism-charge","title":"相对主义之疑","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zhuangzi/controversies-and-appraisal/debates/relativism-charge","wordCount":2011,"readingTime":9}],"introHtml":"<p>本章审视围绕庄子的两场争议。&quot;消极避世之议&quot;——庄子的思想究竟是消极逃避现实，还是积极的精神超越？本章辨析指出，庄子是在洞察现实之后的超越而非逃避，是对乱世的另一种回应。&quot;相对主义之疑&quot;——&quot;齐物论&quot;是否否认一切是非价值？本章辨析指出，齐物论的真意是超越对立、通达自由，而非否定一切的相对主义。本章以全面辩证的态度辨析这些争议。</p>\n"}